1. SCOPE / ALCANCE
===================================================================

This licence covers everything in this repository EXCEPT the font
software under `fonts/`, which is third-party and covered by section 3.

Covered material includes, without limitation: the design tokens in
`colors_and_type.css`; the logos, isotypes, wordmarks, product glyphs
and lockups under `assets/` and `products/`; the brand voice, rules and
non-negotiables in `README.md`, `SKILL.md` and `docs/`; the component
specifications; the preview specimens; the UI kit under `ui_kits/`; the
MCP server under `aglaya-ds-mcp/`; and the tooling under `tools/`,
`scripts/` and `bin/`.

Esta licencia cubre todo el repositorio EXCEPTO las tipografías de
`fonts/`, que son de terceros y se rigen por la sección 3.

